## Cell 12: Build the six dimensions

What it does:

- Creates customer-agreement, service, reporting-week, TCR, category, and sales-representative dimensions.
- Keeps readable source values and normalized search values.

Say:

> These are small lookup dimensions that make the model easier to understand and validate. They preserve readable values for users and search, while the facts use consistent interim keys.

Then be clear:

> These are POC source-value dimensions. They are not final master-data dimensions or governed enterprise IDs.

