What it does:

- Checks every fact and dimension grain for duplicates.
- Checks key collisions and fact-to-dimension coverage.
- Checks that TEU values are nonnegative where applicable.
- Checks that booked TEU equals the sum of the booking outcome components when all components are populated.
- Preserves all-null booking rows instead of silently turning them into zero.

Say:

> Before saving anything, this cell tests whether the model is internally trustworthy. It checks uniqueness, relationships, keys, TEU values, and the booking equation.
>
> All of these checks passed. We also preserved the 305 all-null booking groups for audit. We did not convert missing booking data into zero demand.

