Say:

> This cell proves that separating the grains did not change the business measures. The totals reconcile when each metric is compared at the grain where it belongs.
>
> It also shows why the agent needs care with the wide table. The same booking values can appear on multiple physical allocation rows, so a direct sum can overcount them.

When the sample appears, say:

